entrate very well.\n- D solves problems extremely well.\n- D takes responsibility seriously.\n- D is regarded as a know-it-all.\n- D has a hot temper.\n\nNo explicit mention of reliability, but \"takes responsibility seriously\" suggests reliability. Also \"responds to unexpected events adequately\" suggests reliability under pressure. No explicit teamwork info. \"Hot temper\" and \"know-it-all\" could affect teamwork negatively. So answer: no direct statements about reliability, but responsibility suggests reliability; no explicit teamwork info, but hot temper and know-it-all may hinder crew cooperation. Mention source: own candidate data."}
